# Content and maps

- Mirror human copy from `docs/CONTENT.md` into `client/src/content/*.ts`
- Never rename an id without updating Tiled properties + quests together
- Map contract: 32×32, layers Ground / Decor / Collision / AbovePlayer — see MAP_SPEC.md
- Commit `.tmx` and exported `.json` together
- Every `buildingId` / `npcId` on the map must exist in content; fail loudly on mismatch
- Bump quest `contentVersion` when hunt steps change
